        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare genetic motor neuron disorder characterized by degeneration of alpha motor neurons in the spinal cord and lower brainstem. Proximal spinal muscular atrophy (SMA) type&nbsp;4 is a rare subtype which manifests after 18&nbsp;years of age with mild proximal muscle weakness."
        },
